               "criterion": "Gives the general term x^(n+1)/((n + 1)4^n) for n >= 0, or an equivalent indexing such as x^n/(n 4^(n-1)) for n >= 1, or 4(x/4)^(n+1)/(n + 1).",
               "eligible_only_if": [],
               "check": null
            }
         ]
      },
      {
         "id": "c",
         "prompt": "Find an expression for \\( F(x) \\) in closed form for \\( -4 < x < 4 \\).",
         "setup_required": false,
         "answer_latex": "F(x) = 2 - 4\\ln\\left(1 - \\frac{x}{4}\\right)",
         "worked_solution": [
            {
               "text": "Antidifferentiate the rational form from part (a).",
               "latex": "\\int \\frac{4}{4 - x}\\,dx = -4\\ln(4 - x) + C"
            },
            {
               "text": "Use F(0) = 2 to find C.",
               "latex": "2 = -4\\ln 4 + C \\Rightarrow C = 2 + 4\\ln 4"
            },
            {
               "text": "Combine the logarithms.",
               "latex": "F(x) = 2 - 4\\ln\\left(1 - \\frac{x}{4}\\right)"
            }
         ],
         "points": [
