               ],
               "criterion": "Gives F(x) = 2 - 4 ln(1 - x/4), or an equivalent form such as 2 + 4 ln 4 - 4 ln(4 - x) or 2 + 4 ln(4/(4 - x)), with the constant determined from F(0) = 2.",
